    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>停更了很久，Rex和Hulk又重新连线聊了起来。这次我们依然谈些轻松的，既是关于购物和消费，也是回顾生活里有趣的节点。当然也少不了一些心愿和吐槽。希望能陪你度过轻松有趣的1小时。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Rex、Hulk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> Rex的近期消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> Rex的澳洲之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> Hulk的宁波之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> Hulk的近期消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 心愿清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music: Whirling-In-Rags 8am</span></p>]]></description>
