  <item>
    <title>008 加班时想起新西兰的悠闲，他嘴角还会笑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/606a801257ce953a76ee4d9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">606a801257ce953a76ee4d9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Apr 2021 03:05:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播的话】</span></p><span></span><p><span>他海外漂泊五年，回国后是加班加成狗的审计师。但想起在新西兰的闲适，他嘴角还会笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>海库玛塔第三期，浩克与rex邀请了嘉宾小杰一起聊聊新西兰、澳洲的风土人情。从我们自身出发，议题涉及：新、澳两地与国内生活方式的差异，异乡人探索新西兰的尝试，留学生为什么出（回）国，留学经历给人生的影响等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>浩克(V:tianhaoran7211)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rex(V:runrex)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小杰Jimmy</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">1:40</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 嘉宾的快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 开校车送你去蹦迪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 关于新西兰的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 留学生与本地学生的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 和外国人交流，不一定要靠语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 在新西兰上法庭是怎样一种体会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 关于歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 对探索新西兰做出一些小尝试，我怀疑小杰在开车，但我找不到证据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 在国外的搬砖体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 我在澳洲吃啥？袋鼠肉好吃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">1:01:00</a> 神奇动物在澳洲和新西兰，碗口大蜘蛛和满墙的蟑螂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">1:07:00</a> 新西兰的网红景点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a> 我为什么要回国？关于内卷、生活、家庭&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5160">1:26:00</a> 这段经历带来了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5370">1:29:30</a> 加班时想起在新西兰的闲适，嘴角还会笑一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5580">1:33:00</a> 嘉宾唱歌环节</span></p><span></span><p><span>【注释】</span></p><span></span><p><span>几维鸟（kiwi bird）因叫声“kiwi”得名，被新西兰人看作是自己民族的象征，并且定为</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%9B%BD%E9%B8%9F" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%9B%BD%E9%B8%9F"><span>国鸟</span></a><span>。他们常常自豪地说：“我是一只几维鸟”，意思就是“我是一个新西兰人”。浑身长满蓬松细密的羽毛，既没有翅膀也没有尾羽，不能飞翔。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FkHyuPHv0O-jIMY8dBCSYY4vv5Kj.jpg"></figure><span></span><h1><span>努盖特角灯塔（Nugget Point Lighthouse）：在一天内观天、看海，欣赏努盖特角(Nugget Point)海豹位于新西兰的努盖特角有建于1869年的灯塔、长毛海豹和海狮、灰鸥、鹭鸶和黄眼企鹅(又名“吼一吼”),以及塘鹅栖息地。海浪的巨响回荡在耳边，变化多端的蓝天、无际的海洋和高耸的崖壁引人入胜。</span></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fj_ux6Qk7WsBkdYHcQtbb3J3lpyb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tommy Emmanuel - (Sittin' On) The Dock of the Bay</span></p><span></span><p><span>郭顶-水星记</span></p><span></span><h2><span>小杰-水星记</span></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lganlDYvAtQ5HWrMRtTrLwVINaMY.mp3" length="122112645" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKf-O2X4icKU_-8nn4w2O6gcf-L.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007 我不是没有家，只是没有房子</title>
